<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate gains to 9.77 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 91-day T-bill rate gains to 9.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on 91-day Lithuanian Treasury bills rose to 9.77 percent from 9.46 percent last week, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD    LAST WEEK    MIN/MAX    ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> 91-day	9.77	 9.46	  9.29/10.24   60   77.484 60</p>
<p>The settlement date for today's auction was December 12 and the bills mature on March 13.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
